{"seq":12,"slug":"structural-biology","title":"结构生物学","stage":"DONE","category":"biology-life-science","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/h/biology-life-science/structural-biology","rating":{"composite":3.88,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.6,"coverage":3.75,"positioning":3.5,"strategic":4.67},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introMarkdown":"# 结构生物学\n\n结构生物学回答一个看似简单却深不见底的问题：生命的分子长什么样，又为什么长成那样就能工作。一条氨基酸链折成精确到埃级的形状，一个口袋把催化速率提升上亿倍，一台分子机器把化学能变成定向运动——所有这些功能都写在三维结构里。这个 hub 按一条清晰的递进脉络组织：先看分子本身是什么样，再看怎么把它测出来，接着看怎么用计算预测它，最后看这些能力如何落地成药物、新蛋白与对生命机器的理解。\n\n第一条主线「生物大分子结构」打地基。它讲清蛋白质从序列到四级组装的四个结构层次，讲核酸与核糖核蛋白复合物的特殊之处，再把形状接到功能——活性位点、识别界面、别构、内在无序。这一章建立的概念（疏水核心、构象变化、构象系综）会贯穿后面所有章节。\n\n第二条主线「结构测定方法」回答「怎么看见」。X 射线晶体学靠周期性晶格放大衍射，是高分辨主力；冷冻电镜不需结晶、擅长大而柔的复合体，正经历分辨率革命；核磁共振与小角散射在溶液里测动态与整体形状。三者各有边界，互补成一个工具箱，越来越多地以整合建模联用。\n\n第三条主线「计算结构生物学」把视角从实验转向预测。它从蛋白质折叠问题的理论根基讲起（Anfinsen、Levinthal、折叠漏斗），到 AlphaFold 如何用共进化信号与深度学习攻克结构预测，再到分子动力学与对接如何模拟运动与相互作用。计算不是要取代实验，而是与之分工：预测给静态快照，模拟给动态电影，实验给真相。\n\n第四条主线「应用与前沿」把前三条全部汇流到落地目标。结构基础药物设计用结构理性地造药；蛋白质设计反转折叠问题、发明自然界没有的新蛋白；大分子机器与动态结构则把整个 hub 收束到最难也最迷人的问题——捕捉运动中的分子，理解功能如何从构象系综中涌现。四条主线层层递进，最终在「从读懂自然到书写自然」处汇合。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"macromolecules","title":"生物大分子结构","docCount":3,"url":"/h/biology-life-science/structural-biology/macromolecules","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"protein-structure-levels","title":"蛋白质结构层次","url":"/h/biology-life-science/structural-biology/macromolecules/protein-structure-levels"},{"seq":2,"slug":"nucleic-acid-complexes","title":"核酸与复合物结构","url":"/h/biology-life-science/structural-biology/macromolecules/nucleic-acid-complexes"},{"seq":3,"slug":"structure-function","title":"结构与功能关系","url":"/h/biology-life-science/structural-biology/macromolecules/structure-function"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"methods","title":"结构测定方法","docCount":3,"url":"/h/biology-life-science/structural-biology/methods","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"xray-crystallography","title":"X 射线晶体学","url":"/h/biology-life-science/structural-biology/methods/xray-crystallography"},{"seq":2,"slug":"cryo-em","title":"冷冻电镜","url":"/h/biology-life-science/structural-biology/methods/cryo-em"},{"seq":3,"slug":"nmr-saxs","title":"核磁共振与小角散射","url":"/h/biology-life-science/structural-biology/methods/nmr-saxs"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"computational","title":"计算结构生物学","docCount":3,"url":"/h/biology-life-science/structural-biology/computational","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"protein-folding","title":"蛋白质折叠问题","url":"/h/biology-life-science/structural-biology/computational/protein-folding"},{"seq":2,"slug":"alphafold-prediction","title":"AlphaFold 与结构预测","url":"/h/biology-life-science/structural-biology/computational/alphafold-prediction"},{"seq":3,"slug":"md-docking","title":"分子动力学与对接","url":"/h/biology-life-science/structural-biology/computational/md-docking"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"applications","title":"应用与前沿","docCount":3,"url":"/h/biology-life-science/structural-biology/applications","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"structure-based-drug-design","title":"结构基础药物设计","url":"/h/biology-life-science/structural-biology/applications/structure-based-drug-design"},{"seq":2,"slug":"protein-design","title":"蛋白质设计","url":"/h/biology-life-science/structural-biology/applications/protein-design"},{"seq":3,"slug":"macromolecular-machines","title":"大分子机器与动态结构","url":"/h/biology-life-science/structural-biology/applications/macromolecular-machines"}]}]}